       "text": "Adjusted stats of the green planet in \"Galactic Gauntlet\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Prevented the black hole singularity from moving: Visuals",
